    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/f2b08b86b94a5cb59634d14f528a83be.poster.avif?t=1678884481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/f2b08b86b94a5cb59634d14f528a83be.webm?t=1678884481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/f2b08b86b94a5cb59634d14f528a83be.mp4?t=1678884481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Shoot them, blow them up, kill them with fire. Explore ships invaded by alien creatures.<br>Attack From The Void is a top-down shooter with elements of survival horror, where you can only see what the character can see.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/df01149745e629b926fdc80415cf5a15.poster.avif?t=1678884481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/df01149745e629b926fdc80415cf5a15.webm?t=1678884481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/df01149745e629b926fdc80415cf5a15.mp4?t=1678884481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find weapons, ammo, and items that will help you survive. Unlock new areas and rescue any surviving member of the crew.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/e8e5bc252274f5f5492a8dc25f8fe8cd.poster.avif?t=1678884481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346290/extras/e8e5bc252274f5f5492a8dc25f8fe8cd.webm?t=1678884481\" type=\"video/webm